Subject: [PATCH] A return to a session evicted from the eight open views lands
 its kept latest turn and outline in the task that opens it, so its pane
 reveals without waiting on the network, and the session's row read that used
 to gate that first paint now follows as a side read that only refreshes the
 row, logging a refusal and leaving the kept turn on screen; the app's line
 budget is the measured 107,816.

